        "note": "1 row. The three coefficients of S15(d)'s A/C activity quadratic. At 59.5 degF they give -0.29698, so the A/C factor is again exactly 0 -- further from its boundary than mixed-onroad's -0.0189, not closer.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
