        "tags": [
          "adjustment"
        ],
        "note": "24 rows. Supplies 59.5 degF at hour 7, where the A/C activity quadratic is -0.297 and still clamps to 0 but the EV temperature term is +0.015625 and does NOT -- the arm mixed-onroad could not reach at 66.9 degF. `relHumidity` is read and `heatIndex` is NOT: the heat index is DERIVED here from those two columns through lib/meteorology.esm's `heat_index`, so this fixture no longer takes a MeteorologyGenerator output off the reference (docs/meteorology-generator.md 8.2).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
