        "note": "1 row: polProcessID 9101, fuelTypeID 9, regClassID 0, model years 1950-2060. regClassID 0 is a WILDCARD, and reaching it is what makes the EV temperature factor 1.015625 here rather than 1: the lookup is by exact regClassID first and by the 0 row second (adjust.rs:495-520), which is lib/adjustments.esm's `exact_else_wildcard`. No 11710 row, so tire wear's own temperature factor is the standard quadratic with zero terms, exactly 1.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
